boldsymbol v\\rvert$，则坐标分量满足","formula":"\\boldsymbol v=(x,y),\\qquad \\lvert\\boldsymbol v\\rvert=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}","geometric_meaning":"向量终点的横、纵坐标分别给出两个坐标轴方向的分量；$x,y$ 的符号决定终点所在象限。下面四个案例分别对应由方向和长度求坐标、由坐标判断象限，以及东北方向的分量表示。","searchable_text":["方向、象限与分层例题","从方向和长度确定坐标，再由坐标符号判断象限。","\\boldsymbol v=(x,y),\\qquad \\lvert\\boldsymbol v\\rvert=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}","二维非零向量 $\\boldsymbol v=(x,y)$ 的方向由从原点指向终点的射线确定。\n\n若方向与 $x$ 轴正向的夹角为 $\\theta$、长度为 $\\lvert\\boldsymbol v\\rvert$，则坐标分量满足","向量终点的横、纵坐标分别给出两个坐标轴方向的分量；$x,y$ 的符号决定终点所在象限。下面四个案例分别对应由方向和长度求坐标、由坐标判断象限，以及东北方向的分量表示。"],"sections":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.vector.direction-examples"],"id":"definition","text":"二维非零向量 $\\boldsymbol v=(x,y)$ 的方向由从原点指向终点的射线确定。\n\n若方向与 $x$ 轴正向的夹角为 $\\theta$、长度为 $\\lvert\\boldsymbol v\\rvert$，则坐标分量满足","title":"definition"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.vector.direction-examples"],"id":"formula","text":"\\boldsymbol v=(x,y),\\qquad \\lvert\\boldsymbol v\\rvert=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}","title":"formula"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.vector.direction-examples"],"id":"worked_examples","text":"$$\\lvert\\boldsymbol v\\rvert\\approx2.83,\\qquad \\theta=45^\\circ\\Longrightarrow x=y=a$$\n$$\\sqrt{a^2+a^2}=a\\sqrt2\\approx2.83\\Longrightarrow a\\approx2$$\n$$\\boldsymbol v=(2,2)$$","title":"worked_examples"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.vector.direction-examples"],"id":"geometric_meaning","text":"向量终点的横、纵坐标分别给出两个坐标轴方向的分量；$x,y$ 的符号决定终点所在象限。下面四个案例分别对应由方向和长度求坐标、由坐标判断象限，以及东北方向的分量表示。","title":"geometric_meaning"}],"summary":"从方向和长度确定坐标，再由坐标符号判断象限。","symbol_roles":{"a":"vector_a","b":"vector_b","v":"vector_a"},"title":"方向、象限与分层例题","worked_examples":[{"calculation":["$$\\lvert\\boldsymbol v\\rvert\\approx2.83,\\qquad \\theta=45^\\circ\\Longrightarrow x=y=a$$","$$\\sqrt{a^2+a^2}=a\\sqrt2\\approx2.83\\Longrightarrow a\\approx2$$","$$\\boldsymbol v=(2,2)$$"],"checks":[{"expected":8.0,"name":"dot","tolerance":1e-09}],"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.vector.direction-examples"],"given":[[2,2],[2,2]],"id":"example.direction.right-up","kind":"inner_product","result":8.0,"title":"案例一：右上方且成 45°"},{"calculation":["$$\\theta=90^\\circ,\\qquad x=0,\\qquad \\lvert\\boldsymbol v\\rvert=3$$","$$\\boldsymbol v=(0,3)$$"],"checks":[{"expected":9.0,"name":"dot","tolerance":1e-09}],"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.vector.direction-examples"],"given":[[0,3],[0,3]],"id":"example.direction.vertical","kind":"inner_product","result":9.0,"title":"案例二：竖直向上"},{"calculation":["$$\\boldsymbol a=(2,3),\\qquad \\boldsymbol b=(-1,4)$$","$$a_x>0,\\ a_y>0\\Longrightarrow\\boldsymbol a\\text{ 的终点在第一象限}$$","$$b_x<0,\\ b_y>0\\Longrightarrow\\boldsymbol b\\text{ 的终点在第二象限}$$"],"checks":[{"expected":10.0,"name":"dot","tolerance":1e-09}],"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.vector.direction-examples"],"given":[[2,3],[-1,4]],"id":"example.direction.quadrants","kind":"inner_product","result":10.0,"title":"案例三：由坐标判断象限"},{"calculation":["$$\\lvert\\boldsymbol v\\rvert=10,\\qquad \\text{东北方向}\\Longrightarrow x=y=a$$","$$a\\sqrt2=10\\Longrightarrow a=\\frac{10}{\\sqrt2}\\approx7.07$$","$$\\boldsymbol v\\approx(7.07,7.07)$$"],"checks":[{"expected":[7.07,7.07],"name":"sum","tolerance":1e-09}],"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.vector.direction-examples"],"given":[[7.07,7.07],[0,0]],"id":"example.direction.northeast","kind":"vector_addition","result":[7.07,7.07],"title":"案例四：东北方向的航行"}]},"generated":{"artifact_digest":"sha256:3bddcbb2f73b945e57465e16f5e9ea99c9dbf28b37a929dfb83d685368f42235","generated_at":"2026-09-11T03:55:06Z","model":"lecture-grounded-v2","prompt_version":"teaching-artifact-v1","provider":"math-explanation-sample","raw_reply_digest":"sha256:a20c895ef52a3fd9ecdbcf69098aceb7e19fc922d13fa868732b20c4a033bce1","schema_version":1,"source_hash":"sha256:c919ead1bc4a41fcc9768573ff28bcbdf15001600d5615996da28f7132bdf158"},"revision":15,"schema_version":1,"source":{"excerpt":"#### 1.1.4 分层例题\n\n**【理解层】**从几何到代数\n例1：一个箭头指向右上方，与 x 轴成 $45^\\circ$，长度 $\\approx 2.83$。写出其坐标。\n分析：$45^\\circ$ 意味着两个分量相等。设 $x = y = a$，由 $|v| = \\sqrt{a^{2} + a^{2}} = a\\sqrt{2} \\approx 2.83$，得 $a \\approx 2$。\n答案：$(2, 2)$\n例2：一个箭头竖直向上，长度为 3。写出其坐标。\n分析：x 方向分量为 0，y 方向分量为 3。\n答案：$(0, 3)$\n**【计算层】**从代数到几何\n例3：给定 $a = (2, 3)$ 和 $b = (-1, 4)$，在纸上画出它们的箭头，并指出各自在第几象限。\na 的终点在第一象限（$x>0$，$y>0$）；b 的终点在第二象限（$x<0$，$y>0$）。\n**【应用层】**\n例4：一艘船向东北方向航行了 10 公里。用向量表示这段航行（以正东为 x 轴正方向，正北为 y 轴正方向）。\n分析：东北方向即 x 和 y 各走相等距离。设 $|v| = 10$，$x = y = a$。$a\\sqrt{2} = 10 \\rightarrow a \\approx 7.07$。\n答案：$(7.07, 7.07)$","heading_level":4,"heading_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.1 向量的几何表示","1.1.4 分层例题"],"neighboring_titles":["1.1.3 坐标系的约定"],"occurrence":1,"source_hash":"sha256:c919ead1bc4a41fcc9768573ff28bcbdf15001600d5615996da28f7132bdf158","source_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.1 向量的几何表示","1.1.4 分层例题"],"spans":[{"end_line":79,"fingerprint":"sha256:c919ead1bc4a41fcc9768573ff28bcbdf15001600d5615996da28f7132bdf158","heading_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.1 向量的几何表示","1.1.4 分层例题"],"id":"第1章 向量与几何测量 / 1.1 向量的几何表示 / 1.1.4 分层例题::1::sha256:c919ead1bc4a41fcc9768573ff28bcbdf15001600d5615996da28f7132bdf158","start_line":63,"text":"#### 1.1.4 分层例题\n\n**【理解层】**从几何到代数\n例1：一个箭头指向右上方，与 x 轴成 $45^\\circ$，长度 $\\approx 2.83$。写出其坐标。\n分析：$45^\\circ$ 意味着两个分量相等。设 $x = y = a$，由 $|v| = \\sqrt{a^{2} + a^{2}} = a\\sqrt{2} \\approx 2.83$，得 $a \\approx 2$。\n答案：$(2, 2)$\n例2：一个箭头竖直向上，长度为 3。写出其坐标。\n分析：x 方向分量为 0，y 方向分量为 3。\n答案：$(0, 3)$\n**【计算层】**从代数到几何\n例3：给定 $a = (2, 3)$ 和 $b = (-1, 4)$，在纸上画出它们的箭头，并指出各自在第几象限。\na 的终点在第一象限（$x>0$，$y>0$）；b 的终点在第二象限（$x<0$，$y>0$）。\n**【应用层】**\n例4：一艘船向东北方向航行了 10 公里。用向量表示这段航行（以正东为 x 轴正方向，正北为 y 轴正方向）。\n分析：东北方向即 x 和 y 各走相等距离。设 $|v| = 10$，$x = y = a$。$a\\sqrt{2} = 10 \\rightarrow a \\approx 7.07$。\n答案：$(7.07, 7.07)$"}]},"status":"published","teaching_profile":{"minimum_level":2,"required_sections":["definition","formula","worked_examples","geometric_meaning"],"requires_analogy_boundary":false},"topic_id":"ch01.vector.direction-examples","visual_semantics":{"entities":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.vector.direction-examples"],"dimension":2,"id":"direction_1_a","kind":"vector","label":"v","role":"vector_a","value":[2,2]},